    "detailed_description": "Welcome to &quot;Goo Go&quot;!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/fb2a13cb5e17dfd2b215ca11fbc80707.poster.avif?t=1719601608\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/fb2a13cb5e17dfd2b215ca11fbc80707.webm?t=1719601608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Control Goo using a triple jump and movement keys to overcome obstacles and climb higher and higher. This is a very challenging game that will test your skills, patience, and of course, your nerves.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><br>\u2013 Challenging but not impossible gameplay. Persistence and practice will help you reach the top.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/dd2e2b68b4626531aae2cd93baae4079.poster.avif?t=1719601608\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/dd2e2b68b4626531aae2cd93baae4079.webm?t=1719601608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>\u2013 Every obstacle is designed with intention and requires precision.<br>\u2013 Focused gameplay without distracting elements.<br>\u2013 You are immortal! But every mistake or haste will send you back to the very start.<br>\u2013 Jump, jump, slide, fall, and start over. And over, and over again.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/42045155560689a956b6bed435660638.poster.avif?t=1719601608\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/42045155560689a956b6bed435660638.webm?t=1719601608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>\u2013 Tests of endurance and patience.<br><br><u>Note from the developer:</u><br>This game was created by one person \u2014 me. I was inspired by games like &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy,&quot; &quot;A Difficult Game About Climbing,&quot; and the first version of &quot;Only Up!&quot; These games are homages to the older game &quot;Sexy Hiking&quot; by Jazzuo. I have mixed feelings about such games: I both hate and love them at the same time. They burn neurons but also bring joy from achievements. I wanted to contribute to the &quot;Foddian Type&quot; genre and create not just a clone, but something unusual.<br><br>Good luck and patience!<br><br>Discord Community - ",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to &quot;Goo Go&quot;!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/fb2a13cb5e17dfd2b215ca11fbc80707.poster.avif?t=1719601608\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/fb2a13cb5e17dfd2b215ca11fbc80707.webm?t=1719601608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Control Goo using a triple jump and movement keys to overcome obstacles and climb higher and higher. This is a very challenging game that will test your skills, patience, and of course, your nerves.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><br>\u2013 Challenging but not impossible gameplay. Persistence and practice will help you reach the top.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/dd2e2b68b4626531aae2cd93baae4079.poster.avif?t=1719601608\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/dd2e2b68b4626531aae2cd93baae4079.webm?t=1719601608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>\u2013 Every obstacle is designed with intention and requires precision.<br>\u2013 Focused gameplay without distracting elements.<br>\u2013 You are immortal! But every mistake or haste will send you back to the very start.<br>\u2013 Jump, jump, slide, fall, and start over. And over, and over again.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/42045155560689a956b6bed435660638.poster.avif?t=1719601608\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030820/extras/42045155560689a956b6bed435660638.webm?t=1719601608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>\u2013 Tests of endurance and patience.<br><br><u>Note from the developer:</u><br>This game was created by one person \u2014 me. I was inspired by games like &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy,&quot; &quot;A Difficult Game About Climbing,&quot; and the first version of &quot;Only Up!&quot; These games are homages to the older game &quot;Sexy Hiking&quot; by Jazzuo. I have mixed feelings about such games: I both hate and love them at the same time. They burn neurons but also bring joy from achievements. I wanted to contribute to the &quot;Foddian Type&quot; genre and create not just a clone, but something unusual.<br><br>Good luck and patience!<br><br>Discord Community - ",
    "short_description": "Test your skills, patience, and nerves in a game where one mistake will send you back to the beginning. Oh, and welcome to &quot;Goo Go&quot;!",
